    "page_intro": { "en": "A free interactive Kindergarten reading game about how pictures and stories go together: Otto the owl draws a picture for every part of a little story. HEAR the whole story, then Otto reads ONE part aloud — and you tap the picture that shows that exact moment. Every choice is a real picture from the SAME story, so you have to know which part each illustration shows. Matching a sentence to the moment its picture depicts is the heart of Common Core RL.K.7." },
